back to fiat still involves wire systems and banking hours. This pilot tested a fully integrated model.\\n\\n───\\n\\nSecondary: Morgan Stanley Coming for Coinbase\\n\\nMorgan Stanley launched crypto trading on ETrade, while the White House wants the Clarity Act signed by July 4.\\n\\n───\\n\\nWant me to run the full pipeline and turn this into a published article? 🚀\"\n}\n```\n\nwhere is docx link"}],"timestamp":1778154087308}}
{"type":"message","id":"30f0d700","parentId":"86bfa1ca","timestamp":"2026-05-07T11:41:34.987Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for the Google Doc link. Looking at the conversation, there was a pipeline run earlier today (before my current turn) that published an article. The replied message shows \"The article is live on Google Drive and saved as a draft on WordPress\" - but I don't have access to those links from the previous pipeline run.\n\nI need to check if I can find the Google Doc link from the previous run. Let me search memory or check if there's any record of it.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_wTSa4LO0zYBZalB4cRn02s","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"Google Drive link crypto article docx"}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"minimax.minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":20900,"output":131,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21031,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778154087314}}
